acceptance_criteria: "Every read path that writes output, including direct markdown renders and service strings, answers to --output-budget over the bytes it writes and refuses with exit 2 when it cannot fit; service rendering runs on the projected result; a growing custom renderer cannot exceed the budget, including under token accounting; specs with negative controls cover each path"
